<body>
    <h1>Acc=C3=A8s et installation de Github Copilot</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
 <div class=3D"columnLayout two-right-sidebar" data-layout=3D"two-right-sid=
ebar">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <div class=3D"panel" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
     <div class=3D"panelHeader" style=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
      <b>Objectif(s) / Probl=C3=A9matique(s)</b>
     </div>
     <div class=3D"panelContent">
      <p>Cette page vise =C3=A0 d=C3=A9crire ce qu'il faut faire afin d'acc=
=C3=A9der et utiliser Github Copilot au sein de Beneva</p>
      <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Note" class=3D"confluence-informat=
ion-macro  confluence-information-macro-note">
       <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-ico=
nfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
       <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
        <p>Pour rappel, Github Copilot est un outil =C3=A0 destination des =
=C3=A9quipes de d=C3=A9veloppement, totalement diff=C3=A9rent de Microsoft =
Copilot 365</p>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div>
    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class=3D"cell aside" data-type=3D"aside">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p>
     <style type=3D"text/css">/*<![CDATA[*/
div.rbtoc1776249621978 {padding: 0px;}
div.rbtoc1776249621978 ul {margin-left: 0px;}
div.rbtoc1776249621978 li {margin-left: 0px;padding-left: 0px;}

/*]]>*/</style></p>
