 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"Acc=C3=A8setinstallationdeGithubCopilot-Acc=C3=A8s">Acc=C3=A8=
s</h1>
    <h2 id=3D"Acc=C3=A8setinstallationdeGithubCopilot-Grouped'exclusionZsca=
ler">Groupe d'exclusion Zscaler</h2>
    <p>Pour que l'installation fonctionne correctement, il faut =C3=AAtre m=
embre du groupe d'exclusion Zscaler.</p>
    <p><span class=3D"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u=
 v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak">Pour cela, il faut faire un billet S=
ph=C3=A8re pour faire partie du groupe AD correspondant:&nbsp;</span></p>
    <ul>
     <li><span class=3D"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t=
 u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak">Lien demande Sph=C3=A8re:&nbsp;<a =
class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://beneva.valiantys.net/plugins/servle=
t/desk/portal/11/create/244" rel=3D"nofollow">Gestion des acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0=
 un groupe de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</a></span></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"eca2ea1f-f00e-4f4b-9dc0-75e72df3b1fb"><span class=3D"=
ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af=
 ag ah ai aj ak">Groupe =C3=A0 demander: <strong>APP-zScaler-Internet-TI</s=
trong></span></li>
    </ul>
    <h2 id=3D"Acc=C3=A8setinstallationdeGithubCopilot-LicenceGithubCopilot"=
>Licence Github Copilot</h2>
    <p>En plus du groupe d'exclusion Zscaler, il vous faut demander une lic=
ence Github Copilot.</p>
    <p>Pour ce faire il suffit de faire une demande Sph=C3=A8re <a class=3D=
"external-link" href=3D"https://beneva.valiantys.net/plugins/servlet/desk/p=
ortal/8/create/489" rel=3D"nofollow">Gestion d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s (applicat=
if ou logiciel)</a> en pr=C3=A9cisant "Github Copilot" dans le champs "Appl=
ication"</p>
    <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-=
manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" h=
eight=3D"508" src=3D"2a04dd757b74b001c958ab3aa8b35708ecadd944daa66d094a00b3=
afe287e887" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/567083024/image-2024-9-=
26_14-41-41.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1769701672285&amp;api=3D=
v2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"56708303=
0" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachme=
nt" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2024-9-26_14-41-41.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://confluence.int.beneva.ca" data-linked-resource-conten=
t-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"567083024" data-l=
inked-resource-container-version=3D"7" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468=
"></span></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Une fois ce billet r=C3=A9alis=C3=A9, vous ferez partie du groupe AD=
 <strong>CLD-ENTAPP-GitHub-Copilot</strong> vous attribuant ainsi une licen=
ce.</p>
    <h1 id=3D"Acc=C3=A8setinstallationdeGithubCopilot-Installation">Install=
ation</h1>
    <p>Github Copilot est utilisable de diff=C3=A9rente mani=C3=A8res qui n=
e sont pas propres =C3=A0 Beneva. La documentation officielle la plus "cent=
ralis=C3=A9e" est <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://docs.github.co=
m/en/copilot/get-started/quickstart" rel=3D"nofollow">https://docs.github.c=
om/en/copilot/get-started/quickstart</a></p>
    <p>Dans celle-ci vous pouvez choisir votre outil en utilisant les ongle=
ts de s=C3=A9lection</p>
    <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-=
manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-ima=
ge-border" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"140" width=3D"468" src=3D"565959c3=
11b634404902210188b314d461886c6e450cdd03f61fd602658a18ff" data-image-src=3D=
"/download/attachments/567083024/image-2026-1-29_11-6-21.png?version=3D1&am=
p;modificationDate=3D1769702781757&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-co=
unt=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"567083113" data-linked-resource-versio=
n=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-defau=
lt-alias=3D"image-2026-1-29_11-6-21.png" data-base-url=3D"https://confluenc=
e.int.beneva.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linke=
d-resource-container-id=3D"567083024" data-linked-resource-container-versio=
n=3D"7" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Il est =C3=A9galement possible d'utiliser Github Copilot au travers =
de&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://github.com/github/copilo=
t-cli" rel=3D"nofollow">Github Copilot CLI</a>, encore une fois il suffit d=
e suivre <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://github.com/github/copil=
ot-cli?tab=3Dreadme-ov-file#-getting-started" rel=3D"nofollow">la documenta=
tion officielle</a>.</p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
